      "title": "Linta P Jose and Shaju Thomas completed the acquisition of 60% stake in Hari Govind International Limited from Sunita Maniyar and Jugal Kishore Maniyar.",
      "body": "Linta P Jose and Shaju Thomas agreed to acquire 60% stake in Hari Govind International Limited from Sunita Maniyar and Jugal Kishore Maniyar for INR 30 million on May 14, 2025. A cash consideration of INR 30 million valued at INR 10 per share will be paid by Linta P Jose and Shaju Thomas. As part of consideration, INR 30 million is paid towards common equity of Hari Govind International Limited.\n\nThe transaction is subject to approval of merger agreement by target board. The deal has been approved by the board of Hari Govind International Limited.\n\nLinta P Jose and Shaju Thomas completed the acquisition of 60% stake in Hari Govind International Limited from Sunita Maniyar and Jugal Kishore Maniyar on February 14, 2026.",
