      "body": "Hari Govind International Limited announced the appointment of Mr. Abhilash Thekkumpurath (PAN: AOMPT0471L) as the Chief Financial Officer of the Company designated as the key managerial person of the Company with effect from February 7, 2026. Mr. Abhilash Thekkumpurath holds a Master’s Degree in Commerce (M.Com) from the University of Calicut. He has over 15 years of professional experience in the field of Finance and Accounts, covering financial planning and analysis, accounting, budgeting, statutory and regulatory compliances, internal controls, and financial reporting. He has over 11 years of experience in managing finance and accounts functions within the textile manufacturing sector. His experience covers financial operations, cost management, budgeting, compliance, and financial con",
